\par \pard\li175 \cf1 
\par \f4 Shields offer the best protection against enemy cannon and missile fire. Each Herc has a different set of Shield classes available for defense. Each Shield is rated in three ways:
\par Maximum Shield Level \'96 the Shield strength undamaged.
\par Regeneration Rate \'96 the amount of power restored to the Shield Level after each turn, assuming a perfect operating condition. (Shields can be damaged by incoming fire.)
\par Energy Used Per Turn \'96 the amount of reactor power required to set the Shields at the beginning of each turn.
\par \pard\li175 
\par Also notice that better Shields will negatively affect the Speed Rating of  the Herc.
\par \pard 
